 pests and diseases.\n- Improving soil fertility: Legumes, for example, have nitrogen-fixing bacteria in their roots, which can add nutrients to the soil.\n- Enhancing biodiversity: Crop rotation can help to maintain or increase the diversity of plant and animal species in an area.\n- Reducing soil erosion: Different crops have different root depths and growth habits, which can help to hold the soil in place and reduce erosion.", "new_cot_probs": [0.0, 1.0, 0.0, 0.0], "cot_prob": [-89.0], "cot_step_prob": [-89.0]}, "1": {"completion": "B): dirt quality. This is because crop rotation", "probs": [7.304675818886608e-05, 0.8612152934074402, 0.13207164406776428, 0.006575459614396095], "prediction": 1, "target_cot_step": "Crop rotation is a technique used in agriculture to improve soil health and fertility.", "target_cot_step_prefix": "Human: Question: Crop rotation has a positive impact on what?\n\nChoices:\n(A): government mentality\n(B): dirt quality\n(C): town economies\n(D): crop watering\n\nAssistant: Let's think step by step:\n", "specificity_preds": [2, 2, 0, 2, 3, 0, 1, 3, 2, 1, 3, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 3, 3, 3, 3], "specificity_probs": [[0.017423124983906746, 0.017423124983906746, 0.951270341873169, 0.013569141738116741], [0.05070582777261734, 0.021137334406375885, 0.6999723315238953, 0.22724774479866028], [0.9369741678237915, 0.059898752719163895, 0.0023225268814712763, 0.00045733267324976623], [0.016664229333400726, 0.06590831279754639, 0.9098361134529114, 0.00541008310392499], [0.014910855330526829, 0.08580605685710907, 0.339369535446167, 0.559525728225708], [0.4833972454071045, 0.42659658193588257, 0.06542070209980011, 0.024066930636763573], [0.021077105775475502, 0.8962212800979614, 0.008786245249211788, 0.07356632500886917], [0.010714629665017128, 0.020017562434077263, 0.0027090825606137514, 0.9645001888275146], [0.025650909170508385, 0.009436442516744137, 0.9625433087348938, 0.001858145697042346], [0.0030918270349502563, 0.9714231491088867, 0.0024079172872006893